      "text": "\u2022 PROPOSED -> POLICY_CHECKED -> MANDATED -> EXECUTING -> FULFILLED\n\u2022 Row lock (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE) blocks parallel duplicate execution\n\u2022 Idempotency key primary constraint guarantees 0 duplicate charges",
      "fontSize": 11,
